From 9019108b5307b25b43d184a6a007793e20511fa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MaySoMusician <maysomusician@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:24:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/22] ✨ feat(openai): keep GPT requests non-streaming and
 summary-free
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

GPT models on the OpenAI provider are always sent with stream: false and
without a reasoning summary. The explicit non-streaming and Responses API
lists cover every GPT generation, including gpt-6.2-astra and gpt-6.2-sol,
so routes that read the lists (Azure, aggregators) behave the same.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <claude@anthropic.com.invalid>
---
