From: MaySoMusician <maysomusician@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 15:19:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/22] ✨ feat(agent): keep prompts explicitly user-controlled
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Only the agent's own prompt and user-authored text reach the system prompt.
The inbox gets no default system role, no reply-language line is appended
to any agent (getAgentRuntimeConfig and resolveAgentConfig), and the
system-date, model-info and agent-account injectors are gone.

